<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2009_7497.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser freündtlich willig dienst, zuvor, edlen,
<lb n="2"/>ehrvesten, fürsichtigen, ehrsamen und weisen,
<lb n="3"/>besonders lieben und guoten freünden.
<lb n="4"/>Verschinen zinstags abendts haben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßere</unclear>
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbarn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Abbts</unclear> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sant</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinderlaßne</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">räht</unclear> berichtet, daß dem Sultzischen jetz wer=
<lb n="7"/>benden regiment, wie auch denen soldaten,
<lb n="8"/>so zuo ergentzung deß Madruzischen im <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mey=</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volckh</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alles</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lander</unclear> gepiet ligenden regiments diser zeit
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">6000</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mann</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">be=</unclear> auch geworben werden, der paß durch <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-70" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Uri</unclear></placeName>,
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lauffen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solle</unclear>, <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-71" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schweitz</unclear></placeName> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-541" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gottshauß</unclear></orgName> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sant</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="12"/>landtschafft albereit bewilliget seye, und
<lb n="13"/>daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> solchem durchzug diser tagen albereit ein
<lb n="14"/>anfang gemacht werde, welches wir
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. hiemit berichten, und darbey
<lb n="16"/>nit ermanglen wellen, ihren beyligende
<lb n="17"/>copey eines von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-32" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Zürich</placeName> auß, an unß abge=
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoübersenden</unclear>, fertigten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schreibens</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auß</unclear> welchem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leichtlich</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuovernemmen</unclear>, worauf es angesehen seyn
<lb n="20"/>möchte, Und bleiben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>.
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angenemmer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diensterzeigung</unclear> wol bey=
<lb n="22"/>gethan. Unß sämbtlich darmit göttlicher
<lb n="23"/>bewahrung wol befelhende. Datum
<lb n="24"/>den. <origDate when="1636" resp="#ner">23. ten Junij anno <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">1636</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="25"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">B</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">raht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">d</unclear>.</orgName>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">An</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-510" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">burgermeister und raht der statt Ulm</orgName>,
<lb n="27"/>mutatis mutandis
<lb n="28"/>An <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-511" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">burgermeister und raht der statt Lindauw</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2009_7498.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">An</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-4" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Vberl</unclear>.</placeName> und <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-24" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Lindauw</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abg</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">avisschrb</unclear>.
<lb n="30"/><origDate resp="#ner">13. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Junij</unclear></origDate>.
</p>
